+the slug, so no file changes and every launcher resolves the new name
+immediately. Refused (exit 3) for an unknown slug, a curated slug, or a new name
+that already exists anywhere in the catalog — renaming onto a curated slug would
+just shadow it again. `--dry-run` prints the plan.
